  "description": "No.94 Sli Gheal is an very impressive Four-bedroom mid-terrace residence located on the Ballymoneen Road in a well established residential development. This superb home offers approximately 132m2 of well-designed living space, making it an ideal choice for first-time buyers, growing families, or purchasers seeking a modern home in a highly convenient west-side location.\nPositioned overlooking in a private cul de sac location, No. 94 enjoys a quiet setting within this popular estate. The property also features ample parking to the front and a private west-facing rear garden, capturing excellent afternoon and evening sunlight—perfect for outdoor dining, play, or relaxation.\nInternally, the accommodation is thoughtfully laid out across three levels, offering flexibility and comfort. The ground floor includes a welcoming entrance hall, guest WC, a bright and spacious kitchen/dining area, and a separate living room with direct access to the rear garden. The first floor comprises two well-proportioned bedrooms with an en-suite and a main bathroom, while the top floor hosts the third and fourth bedroom and ensuite. The design ensures plenty of natural light and ample storage throughout the home.\nSli Gheal is a well-regarded residential development off Ballymoneen Road, benefitting from excellent access to schools, shops, regular public transport, and community amenities. Knocknacarra Retail Park, Cappagh Park, local beaches, and the amenities of both Salthill and Galway City are all within easy reach. This combination of strong location, quality design, and generous accommodation ensures enduring appeal.",
